{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30344","headline":"二 · 赵嘏","name":"二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"折柳城边起暮愁，可怜春色独怀忧。\n伤心正叹人间事，回首更惭江上鸥。\n鶗鴂声中寒食雨，芙蓉花外夕阳楼。\n凭高满眼送清渭，去傍故山山下流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}